<section class="gg-lab-hero">
  <div class="gg-lab-grid-bg"></div>

  <div class="gg-container gg-lab-hero-grid">
    <div class="gg-lab-copy reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Support Goal Grower</span>

      <h1>Fund the next stage of the garden.</h1>

      <p>
        Goal Grower is moving from beta toward launch. Support helps turn a working app
        into a calmer, clearer, more motivating experience for real people.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions">
        <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-btn">Support the Build</a>
        <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn-soft">Test the Beta</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-lab-core reveal">
      <div class="gg-lab-ring ring-large"></div>
      <div class="gg-lab-ring ring-small"></div>

      <div class="gg-lab-seed">
        <span>Goal Grower</span>
        <strong>Beta</strong>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-lab-chip chip-one">
        <strong>Testing</strong>
        <span>real users</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-lab-chip chip-two">
        <strong>Polish</strong>
        <span>clearer flow</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-lab-chip chip-three">
        <strong>Launch</strong>
        <span>store prep</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-lab-chip chip-four">
        <strong>Features</strong>
        <span>shared growth</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="gg-container gg-manifesto-layout">

  <div class="gg-manifesto-intro reveal">
    <span class="gg-kicker">The Mission</span>

    <h2>
      Progress should feel
      <br>
      alive.
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="gg-manifesto-cards reveal">

    <div class="gg-manifesto-card">
      <span>01</span>
      <p>
        Goal Grower is not being built to make people feel behind.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-manifesto-card">
      <span>02</span>
      <p>
        It is being built to help people return after busy days,
        missed goals, and imperfect weeks.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-manifesto-card">
      <span>03</span>
      <p>
        Support helps transform that belief into a real product.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

</div>

<section class="gg-support-graph-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-support-graph-copy reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Support Studio</span>

      <h2>Support moves the whole roadmap forward.</h2>

      <p>
        Development starts the app. Testing reveals the truth. Feedback shapes the experience.
        Launch brings Goal Grower to real users, and future projects grow from the same mission.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-roadmap-line reveal">
      <svg class="gg-roadmap-svg" viewBox="0 0 1250 520" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path
  class="gg-roadmap-path"
  d="M 40 430 C 210 410, 330 382, 470 330 S 690 245, 840 180 S 1025 105, 1240 35"
/>
      </svg>

      <div class="graph-step step-development">
        <div class="graph-node"></div>
        <div class="graph-label">
          <strong>Development</strong>
          <span>The first version of Goal Grower comes to life.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="graph-step step-testing">
        <div class="graph-node"></div>
        <div class="graph-label">
          <strong>Testing</strong>
          <span>Real people use it and reveal what matters.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="graph-step step-feedback">
        <div class="graph-node"></div>
        <div class="graph-label">
          <strong>Feedback</strong>
          <span>Insights become the blueprint for improvement.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="graph-step step-launch">
        <div class="graph-node"></div>
        <div class="graph-label">
          <strong>Launch</strong>
          <span>Goal Grower becomes available to everyone and begins helping people grow goals in the real world.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="graph-step step-projects">
        <div class="graph-node"></div>
        <div class="graph-label">
          <strong>More Projects</strong>
          <span>Future tools and ideas continue the mission beyond Goal Grower.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-lab-roles">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Choose your role</span>
      <h2>Support can look like testing, funding, or sharing.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-lab-role-track">
      <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-lab-role reveal">
        <span>Tester</span>
        <h3>Try the beta.</h3>
        <p>Use the app and share what feels useful, confusing, or motivating.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-lab-role featured reveal">
        <span>Supporter</span>
        <h3>Fund the build.</h3>
        <p>Help cover testing, design polish, launch prep, and future development.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-lab-role reveal">
        <span>Customer</span>
        <h3>Shop the mission.</h3>
        <p>Support through digital tools, products, and future Goal Grower items.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="support-development" class="gg-direct-support">
      <div class="gg-direct-support-copy">
        <span class="gg-kicker">Support development</span>

        <h2>Help Bring <span class="gg-highlight">Goal Grower</span><br>to Life</h2>

        <p>
          Help fund app testing, design polish, launch preparation, and future development.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-direct-support-side">
        <div class="gg-support-amounts">
          {% assign support_5 = all_products['support-goal-grower-5'] %}
          {% assign support_10 = all_products['support-goal-grower-10'] %}
          {% assign support_25 = all_products['support-goal-grower-25'] %}

          {% if support_5 %}
            <a href="/cart/add?id={{ support_5.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}&quantity=1&return_to=/cart" class="gg-support-amount">
              <strong>$5</strong>
              <span>Small support</span>
            </a>
          {% endif %}

          {% if support_10 %}
            <a href="/cart/add?id={{ support_10.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}&quantity=1&return_to=/cart" class="gg-support-amount featured">
              <strong>$10</strong>
              <span>Help the build</span>
            </a>
          {% endif %}

          {% if support_25 %}
            <a href="/cart/add?id={{ support_25.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}&quantity=1&return_to=/cart" class="gg-support-amount">
              <strong>$25</strong>
              <span>Launch support</span>
            </a>
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        {% assign custom_support = all_products['custom-support-goal-grower'] %}

        {% if custom_support %}
          <div class="gg-custom-support">
            <div class="gg-custom-copy">
              <strong>Custom</strong>
              <span>Choose your own support amount.</span>
            </div>

            <form action="/cart/add" method="post" class="gg-custom-support-form">
              <input 
                type="hidden" 
                name="id" 
                value="{{ custom_support.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}"
              >

              <input
                type="hidden"
                name="properties[Support type]"
                value="Custom Goal Grower support"
              >

              <label for="custom-support-amount">Amount</label>

              <div class="gg-custom-input-wrap">
                <span>$</span>
                <input 
                  id="custom-support-amount"
                  type="number" 
                  name="quantity" 
                  min="15" 
                  value="15"
                  step="1" 
                  required
                >
              </div>

              <button type="submit" class="gg-custom-submit">
                Add Support
              </button>
            </form>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </section>

<section class="gg-lab-needs">
  <div class="gg-container gg-lab-needs-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker light">Current needs</span>
      <h2>The next version needs real feedback.</h2>
      <p>
        The core idea is working. Now the app needs more people using it, breaking it,
        questioning it, and helping it become easier to return to.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-lab-question-stack reveal">
      <div>
        <strong>What makes someone want to come back?</strong>
        <span>Testing reveals what actually feels motivating.</span>
      </div>

      <div>
        <strong>Where does the flow feel confusing?</strong>
        <span>Feedback helps remove friction before launch.</span>
      </div>

      <div>
        <strong>What should the garden become next?</strong>
        <span>Support helps future features grow intentionally.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-lab-close">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-lab-close-panel reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Thank you</span>

      <h2>Help grow something worth returning to.</h2>

      <p>
        If Goal Grower feels like something that should exist, you can help bring it
        closer to release by testing, supporting, or sharing the project.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions center">
        <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-btn">Support Now</a>
        <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn-soft">Join Testing</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Goal Grower Support",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Goal Grower Support"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}